{% comment %}
  Renders Melt's logo as an inline SVG.

  Shopify's image_picker setting won't accept an SVG, so the mark lives in
  assets/melt-logo.svg and is inlined here instead. Being inline means it stays
  crisp at any size, costs no extra request, and inherits the current text
  colour via fill="currentColor" — so it works across Dawn's colour schemes.

  Width follows the "Logo width" theme setting. If a raster logo is uploaded in
  Theme settings → Logo, the header uses that instead and this is not rendered.

  Accepts:
  - class: {String} Optional additional classes for the wrapper.

  Usage:
  {% render 'melt-logo' %}
{% endcomment %}

<span class="header__heading-logo-wrapper header__heading-logo-wrapper--svg{% if class %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
  {{- 'melt-logo.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
</span>
<span class="visually-hidden">{{ shop.name }}</span>
